{"seq":1,"slug":"sfu-mcu-topologies","title":"SFU、MCU 与多方拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/sfu-mcu-topologies","wordCount":1291,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"sfu-mcu-与多方拓扑\">SFU、MCU 与多方拓扑</h1><p>两人通话用 <a href=\"../foundations/webrtc-architecture\">WebRTC 架构与连接模型</a> 里那条直连通道就够了。但把人数加到 5、20、100，问题立刻变质：每端要给每个其他端各编一路上行，上行带宽和 CPU 随人数平方级膨胀。多方实时系统的全部架构智慧，都在于如何重新组织这张拓扑。这一篇讲三种拓扑及其取舍，是多人系统的架构决策核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多方拓扑的差异，本质是「在哪里复制和处理媒体流」。Mesh 让每端直连所有其他端，无中心服务器；MCU 在服务器把所有流混成一路再发回；SFU 在服务器选择性转发，不解码不混流。三者在带宽、服务器成本、灵活性上各有侧重，没有绝对优劣，只有场景匹配。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  subgraph Mesh&#10;    A1[端A] --- B1[端B]&#10;    A1 --- C1[端C]&#10;    B1 --- C1&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph SFU&#10;    A2[端A] --&gt; S2[SFU 转发]&#10;    B2[端B] --&gt; S2&#10;    C2[端C] --&gt; S2&#10;    S2 --&gt; A2&#10;    S2 --&gt; B2&#10;    S2 --&gt; C2&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph MCU&#10;    A3[端A] --&gt; M3[MCU 混流]&#10;    B3[端B] --&gt; M3&#10;    M3 --&gt; A3&#10;    M3 --&gt; B3&#10;  end\">flowchart TD\n  subgraph Mesh\n    A1[端A] --- B1[端B]\n    A1 --- C1[端C]\n    B1 --- C1\n  end\n  subgraph SFU\n    A2[端A] --&gt; S2[SFU 转发]\n    B2[端B] --&gt; S2\n    C2[端C] --&gt; S2\n    S2 --&gt; A2\n    S2 --&gt; B2\n    S2 --&gt; C2\n  end\n  subgraph MCU\n    A3[端A] --&gt; M3[MCU 混流]\n    B3[端B] --&gt; M3\n    M3 --&gt; A3\n    M3 --&gt; B3\n  end</pre><p>下表对比三种拓扑在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 人会议中的成本特征，是选型的量化依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拓扑</th>\n<th>每端上行</th>\n<th>每端下行</th>\n<th>服务器算力</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mesh</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 路</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 路</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>2–4 人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SFU</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 路</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 路</td>\n<td>低（仅转发）</td>\n<td>数十至上百</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MCU</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 路</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 路</td>\n<td>高（解码+混流+编码）</td>\n<td>弱端、电话网关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mesh-为什么撑不过几个人\">Mesh：为什么撑不过几个人</h2><p>Mesh 拓扑最简单——每端和其他每端各建一条 <code>RTCPeerConnection</code>，没有服务器，隐私好、延迟低。但它的上行成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>：4 人会议每端要同时上传 3 路视频。上行通常是家用带宽的瓶颈，按 720p 约 1.5Mbps 算，4 人就要 4.5Mbps 上行，再加编码 3 路的 CPU，普通笔记本很快吃不消。</p>\n<p>Mesh 的连接数也按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{N}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2723em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>连接数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{连接数} = \\frac{N(N-1)}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">连接数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>10 人会议就是 45 条连接，每端 9 条——彻底不可行。所以 Mesh 只适合 2–4 人的小场景，或对服务器成本极度敏感、人数极少的应用。一旦要扩展，必须引入服务器侧拓扑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sfu-现代多人会议的默认选择\">SFU：现代多人会议的默认选择</h2><p>SFU（Selective Forwarding Unit，选择性转发单元）是 2026 年绝大多数视频会议产品的架构基石。每端只上传一路给 SFU，SFU 不解码、不混流，只把每端的流「选择性地」转发给其他端。这样每端上行恒定为 1 路，服务器只做转发（开销远低于混流），可扩展到数十上百人。</p>\n<p>SFU 的威力来自配合 Simulcast 与 SVC——让一个上行流能以不同质量服务不同接收者：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Simulcast</strong>：发送端同时编码同一画面的多个分辨率/码率层（如 180p/360p/720p），SFU 按每个接收者的带宽与布局选发哪一层。2026 年 Simulcast 是 VP8 与 H.264 在所有浏览器的默认（来源：forasoft, 2026）。</li>\n<li><strong>SVC</strong>（可伸缩视频编码）：单个码流内部就分了层，SFU 可直接丢弃高层来降质，无需发送端编多份。2026 年 SVC 是 Chromium 上 VP9 与 AV1 的默认。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 发送端开启 Simulcast：三层编码&#10;pc.addTransceiver(videoTrack, {&#10;  direction: &#39;sendonly&#39;,&#10;  sendEncodings: [&#10;    { rid: &#39;low&#39;, scaleResolutionDownBy: 4, maxBitrate: 150_000 },&#10;    { rid: &#39;mid&#39;, scaleResolutionDownBy: 2, maxBitrate: 500_000 },&#10;    { rid: &#39;high&#39;, scaleResolutionDownBy: 1, maxBitrate: 1_500_000 },&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 发送端开启 Simulcast：三层编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addTransceiver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(videoTrack, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  direction: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sendonly'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sendEncodings: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { rid: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, scaleResolutionDownBy: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxBitrate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { rid: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, scaleResolutionDownBy: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxBitrate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { rid: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, scaleResolutionDownBy: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxBitrate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1_500_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SFU 据此为每个接收者动态选层：网络差的接收者拿 low 层，全屏观看的拿 high 层。这套机制依赖底层的拥塞估计来驱动选层决策，细节见 <a href=\"quality-congestion\">质量、拥塞控制与统计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mcu-与混合架构\">MCU 与混合架构</h2><p>MCU（Multipoint Control Unit，多点控制单元）走另一条路：在服务器把所有参会者的流解码、混合成一路画面（如九宫格）再编码发回。每端只收发一路，对弱端和带宽极低的设备极友好，也是接入传统电话网（PSTN）、做服务端录制合成的天然选择。代价是服务器要为每场会议做完整的解码-混流-编码，CPU 成本高、增加一跳延迟、且接收端失去自定义布局的灵活性。</p>\n<p>下表归纳三种拓扑的工程权衡，帮助决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Mesh</th>\n<th>SFU</th>\n<th>MCU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>服务器成本</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端侧负担</td>\n<td>高（多路上行）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布局灵活性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（服务端定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端加密</td>\n<td>易</td>\n<td>需 Insertable Streams</td>\n<td>难（需解密）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>录制/转推</td>\n<td>难</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>易</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中常用混合架构：默认 SFU，对接电话或服务端录制时局部用 MCU；大型直播则 SFU 接主播、再转码成 <a href=\"../media-pipeline/adaptive-streaming\">自适应码流与 HLS/DASH</a> 分发给海量观众。值得注意的是 SFU 下的端到端加密——因为 SFU 不解密媒体，要在端侧加一层只有参会者能解的加密，靠的是 <a href=\"../practice/recording-transforms\">录制、Insertable Streams 与 WebCodecs</a> 里的 Insertable Streams。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多方拓扑的本质是「在哪里复制/处理媒体」：Mesh 无服务器、MCU 服务端混流、SFU 服务端选择性转发。</li>\n<li>Mesh 上行与连接数随人数平方膨胀（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(N-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 条连接），只适合 2–4 人。</li>\n<li>SFU 是 2026 年多人会议默认：每端上行恒为 1 路，服务器只转发，配合 Simulcast/SVC 给不同接收者发不同质量层。</li>\n<li>2026 年 Simulcast 是 VP8/H.264 默认、SVC 是 Chromium 上 VP9/AV1 默认，两者在现代 SFU 中共存。</li>\n<li>MCU 混流对弱端与电话网关友好，但服务器成本高、布局不灵活；常与 SFU 混合使用。</li>\n<li>SFU 选层依赖拥塞估计（见 <a href=\"quality-congestion\">质量、拥塞控制与统计</a>），端到端加密依赖 <a href=\"../practice/recording-transforms\">Insertable Streams</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SFU、MCU 与多方拓扑","id":"sfu-mcu-与多方拓扑"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Mesh：为什么撑不过几个人","id":"mesh-为什么撑不过几个人"},{"level":2,"text":"SFU：现代多人会议的默认选择","id":"sfu-现代多人会议的默认选择"},{"level":2,"text":"MCU 与混合架构","id":"mcu-与混合架构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MSE、EME 与播放器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/media-pipeline/media-source-playback"},"next":{"title":"DataChannel 与点对点数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/datachannel-p2p"}}